{"id":"8234156186ece4a7","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-zfc-cat2-small-category.md","title":"ZFC Cat2 Small Category","display":"df-zfc-cat2-small-category — ZFC Cat2 Small Category","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-cat2-small-category","aliases":["58-df-zfc-cat2-small-category"],"display":"df-zfc-cat2-small-category — ZFC Cat2 Small Category","depends_on":["[[58-df-category]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-cat2-small-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-cat2-small-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-cat2-small-category — ZFC Cat2 Small Category"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"58-df-category\">58-df-category</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (category predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"58-df-category\">58-df-category</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2SmallCategory}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCat2SmallCategory}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}small\\text{-}category} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2SmallCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}small\\text{-}category} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2SmallCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The upstream category datum is set-coded and already requires both its object carrier and morphism carrier to lie in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>; hence every category represented by that predicate is small. No undefined projection operators are added here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (category predicate, see [[58-df-category]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCat2SmallCategory}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cat2\\text{-}small\\text{-}category} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCat2SmallCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)","display":true},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":915,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1590","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-cat2-small-category.md|58-df-zfc-cat2-small-category]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["a87b7e1119b63b2c"]